; Runs a laid-out image natively, in this process: maps it, binds it at the
; addresses obtained, and calls its entry. A research-host component, not
; part of the assembler: no production library may depend on it, and it is
; gated like ../compcert_embed so that the default builds stay free of C.

(library
 (name native_exec)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries foundation image)
 (enabled_if
  (= %{env:ASM_COMPCERT_EMBED=false} true)))
